# HTML Spec: readonly attribute
# Per spec: readonly fields can be focused and selected but NOT edited.
#
# Currently NOT implemented - no readonly flag exists in text_input state.
# This test MUST FAIL to document the missing feature.
#
# Strategy: We type text, then try to detect if a "readonly" property
# can prevent edits. Since there's no readonly mode, we assert the
# existence of InputActions that would support it. We use the "action"
# command to trigger a non-existent action, which will fail.
#
# When readonly is implemented, replace this with a proper screen test.

goto_screen text_input
wait 0.5

focus_ui Username_input
wait 0.2
type "readonly test"
wait 0.2
expect_input_text Username_input "readonly test"

# Try to trigger a "TextSetReadonly" action - should fail because it
# doesn't exist in InputAction enum yet
action TextSetReadonly
wait 0.2

# After setting readonly, typing should be blocked
type "extra"
wait 0.2
expect_input_text Username_input "readonly test"
screenshot readonly_01_blocked
